& [FSC5FinalSlicesExplosion] is the processing pass that mints final work slices inside FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [root_subject] is FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [chunk_state] is activated_by_FSC4_surface_projection_pack_and_signed_operations_safety_spec
  + [boundary_input] is FSC4 surface projection pack
  + [safety_source] is LangSOP Operations Safety Specification
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_after_gate
  + [slice_strategy] is order slices so operations boundaries and dry-run-only safety are defined before operation request, resource safety, live-control prohibition, fixtures, and final pack acceptance
  + [result] is six final slices, one ready now and five gated inside FSC5

  = must: preserve no unresolved dependency outside FSC5
  = must: make each slice contiguous by expected output and verification oracle
  = must: run completed-work review after each completed slice
  = must: reject any slice that authorizes live control

## Fold 1: Operations Boundary And Safety Authority

& [Fold1OperationsBoundaryAndSafetyAuthority] is the boundary check for FSC5 final slices
  + [inside_boundary] is P9 operations-manager safety and P8e operations safety and dry-run resource fixtures
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC4_Surface_Projection_Pack.v1.sop
  + [safety_source] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop
  + [forbidden_external_dependency] is live process control, GPU mutation, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, and production operations automation

  = must: import FSC1 through FSC4 packs as accepted boundary inputs
  = must: preserve dry-run-only and human override gates
  = must: prevent live control authority from appearing in FSC5 slice outputs

## Fold 2: Slice Chain

& [Fold2SliceChain] is the ordered final slice chain
  + [FSC5-S01] is operations boundary and safety invariant map
  + [FSC5-S02] is dry-run operation request contract
  + [FSC5-S03] is resource safety and human override contract
  + [FSC5-S04] is machine-control non-authority and live-control prohibition gates
  + [FSC5-S05] is operations dry-run fixture plan
  + [FSC5-S06] is FSC5 completion review and safety pack

  = must: keep FSC5-S01 as the only ready slice at first minting
  = must: activate later slices only when their inside-FSC5 inputs are accepted

## Fold 3: Model Routing

& [Fold3ModelRouting] is the route classification for FSC5 slices
  + [FSC5-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S05] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after FSC5-S01 through FSC5-S04 are accepted
  + [FSC5-S06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: state model route on every slice
  = must: keep operations boundary, human override, live-control prohibition, and final acceptance under deeper reasoning
  = should: route dry-run fixture drafting to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after safety contracts stabilize

## Fold 4: Readiness And Gates

& [Fold4ReadinessAndGates] is the current FSC5 readiness pass
  + [ready_slice] is FSC5-S01
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S02 until FSC5-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S03 until FSC5-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S04 until FSC5-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S05 until FSC5-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S06 until FSC5-S05 accepted

  = must: not start a gated slice until its activation gate is accepted
  = must: run completion review before opening the next slice

& [FSC5FinalSlicesConclusion] is the result of this pass
  + [ready_for] is execution of FSC5-S01 operations boundary and safety invariant map
  + [not_ready_for] is operations implementation, live control, automation, job dispatch, credential mutation, network exposure mutation, or destructive filesystem action
  + [remaining_uncertainty] is future live-control authority model, exact target host integration, resource introspection APIs, and human approval carrier

  = must: promote the final slice surface only with satisfaction signature and source lineage
